cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Source Kit — open provenance core"
version: 0.18.4
date-released: 2026-08-17
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - family-names: Pisner
    given-names: Noah
abstract: >-
  The auditable core of Source Kit, an iOS provenance camera:
  on-device C2PA Content Credentials signing, hardware-backed key
  custody with Apple App Attest binding, RFC 3161 and OpenTimestamps
  time anchoring, a pure-TypeScript X.509/COSE verification stack,
  and the validation lab that reproduces every claim offline.
keywords:
  - provenance
  - C2PA
  - content credentials
  - cryptographic verification
  - App Attest
repository-code: "https://github.com/noah-pi/sourcekit-open"
